  "prefLabel": "He-W 803.03 Individual Responsibility to Report Changes",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 803.03 Individual Responsibility to Report Changes. Individuals shall report changes no later than 10 calendar days after the change takes place, pursuant to RSA 167:17, and overpayments shall be recouped only when ordered by a court of law.\n\nSource. #11042, eff 2-24-16; ss by #14634, eff 6-26-26, EXPIRES: 6-26-36",
